hi Neil,
an easty thing to do is take your date vector of length J = 89 (right?) and then replicate it into a matrix with M rows

 X<- matrix(datevector   ,nrow=M,byrow=TRUE)

However, since you have 4 different date vectors (one for each block right?) then you need to construct 4 of these and then rbind() them together basically, assuming that I understand everything correctly.

regards
andy

